  "description": "In the worst neighborhoods, the back of a taxi is called the cage. 5326 is the code, Re-Call Red, a revenge call to end all suffering. Need a bully curb-stomped? Call. Your husband cheat on you? Call. Has your business partner stolen all your money? Call and Deke will be there, waiting for you, for them. The Rainbow Taxi offers the full spectrum of special services. Call now. \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: This Webtoon is adapted into the South Korean Television Drama \"Taxi Driver (2021).\"*",
